得周子善书问京师事及贱迹以绝句十首奉答 其五","author":"宋褧","text":"瑶肝玉肺渥洼驹，玄圃昆崙是坦途。\n暂蹶霜蹄未为失，三年奋迅碧云衢。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8473,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"得周子善书问京师事及贱迹以绝句十首奉答 其六","author":"宋褧","text":"人海茫茫万仞山，健夫争赴碧岩端。\n跻攀分寸不得上，始信文场蜀道难。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8474,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"得周子善书问京师事及贱迹以绝句十首奉答 其七","author":"宋褧","text":"一念遗孤一怆然，心旌无日不悬悬。\n潞阳二月河冰解，定买吴侬燕尾船。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8475,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"得周子善书问京师事及贱迹以绝句十首奉答 其八","author":"宋褧","text":"谢家择婿得逸少，温峤先酬玉镜台。\n罗帐合欢犹有待，可怜孤凤意徘徊。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8476,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"得周子善书问京师事及贱迹以绝句十首奉答 其九","author":"宋褧","text":"迩来吟思浊如泥，今日酬君喜赋诗。\n不识心忪并胆怯，犀珠银液竟何施。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8477,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"得周子善书问京师事及贱迹以绝句十首奉答 其十","author":"宋褧","text":"汨没京尘度岁华，胸中千绪乱如麻。\n南风准拟挥谈麈，剩费君家木杵茶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8478,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"钱圣举山茶","author":"宋褧","text":"丹青笔点水晶宫，为尔寒葩染淡红。\n今日北人多见惯，不须和雪上屏风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8479,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雪竹白头翁横披（二首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"琅玕袅袅碧云空，雪缀斜梢倚北风。\n丹凤不来年岁晚，一枝聊借白头翁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8480,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雪竹白头翁横披（二首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"苍衣雪颈冻难飞，寂寞寒梢独自栖。\n别有春明好风景，绿杨如画乳莺啼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8481,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"出京酬送别者（南游湖湘）","author":"宋褧","text":"台笠华缨洗暗尘，都门官柳送车轮。\n洛阳津吏揶揄我，不是终军等辈人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8482,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"阿城","author":"宋褧","text":"掖庭咫尺失王嫱，库吏奸因鼠粪扬。\n邂逅阿城重怀古，欲从何处吊威王。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8483,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"小姑贤祠","author":"宋褧","text":"离鸾别鹊两沉冥，肠断庐江焦仲卿。\n不见虎丘南畔月，至今常为小姑明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8484,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"舟中述怀","author":"宋褧","text":"饭了从容瞌睡禅，诗情涩似急滩船。\n吟成欲附都人卖，又恐明时不值钱。","collecti