uthor":"宋褧","text":"河流如箭棹如飞，星汉垂光月渐西。\n回首曲廊微步处，文明门上夜乌啼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8516,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晚泊维扬驿（二首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"驿墙红树晚萧萧，解劝征人驻画桡。\n拟办青楼狂载酒，月明何处玉人箫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8517,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晚泊维扬驿（二首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"朱轩翠馆郁岧峣，几处笙歌几处桥。\n怪得隔江人望见，夜深灯火似元宵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8518,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"江上棹歌五首（采石舟中作以相长年三老且以慰使云） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"日南使人朝贡来，东观校书远送回。\n长江无波风伯喜，不须铜钲苦相催。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8519,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"江上棹歌五首（采石舟中作以相长年三老且以慰使云） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"江边日出便解舟，轻帆经过烈山头。\n我侬一日还到驿，你侬何日到邕州。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8520,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"江上棹歌五首（采石舟中作以相长年三老且以慰使云） 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"远人莫愁行路难，故乡万里应须还。\n明朝得风到池口，回首不见蛾眉山。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8521,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"江上棹歌五首（采石舟中作以相长年三老且以慰使云） 其四","author":"宋褧","text":"象奴晚泊卖象梳，金钱卖得相欢呼。\n大信有肉采石酒，何不多买犒棹夫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8522,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"江上棹歌五首（采石舟中作以相长年三老且以慰使云） 其五","author":"宋褧","text":"荻花萧萧江月明，十舟齐发棹歌声。\n但有五两好风信，莫为离别动乡情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8523,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄张仲容（四首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"縠窗昨日君辞妇，白驹今朝我别家。\n马御仆夫都见惯，莫教闺梦到天涯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8524,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄张仲容（四首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"城南城北渺风烟，一度论文月再圆。\n肠断而今更愁绝，蓬莱云隔楚江天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8525,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄张仲容（四首） 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"风流多病汉文园，玉树森森瘦可怜。\n梦里若逢徐福问，仙家何药得长年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8526,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄张仲容（四首） 其四","author":"宋褧","text":"有情谁解不相思，罗幌风乾叶落时。\n莫问离愁有多少，君归犹趁菊花期。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8527,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书汉津驿（九月十二日）","author":"宋褧","text":"凉月满庭清似水，匡床无寐苦难胜。\n闺人不见羁人况，落叶横窗蛾扑灯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8528,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"甄氏坟园春露亭（二首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"白杨如柱草如茵，湛玉零珠苦怆神。\n况是清明风雨恶，可能无泪湿衣巾。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8529,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"甄氏坟园春露亭（二首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"轩楹错粲对泉宫，菽水庭闱在眼中。\n别有孤丘漆灯灭，宁馨何处哭秋风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8530,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鄱阳萧性渊能鼓琴琴号霜钟是其曾大父宋南渡时所畜者其家上世善琴云（二首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"池台肠断雍门周，艮岳繁华逐水流。\n往事寥寥君不见，金仙垂泣渭城秋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8531,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鄱阳萧性渊能鼓琴琴号霜钟是其曾大父宋南渡时所畜者其家上世善琴云（二首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"不似琵琶不似筝，鲸音历历似秋清。\n龟年流落江潭外，谁识秦声与楚声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8532,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"柯敬仲持其乃尊山斋翁遗训诗求跋","author":"宋褧","text":"太傅当年自教儿，唾壶谈麈亦吾师。\n蓼莪流落玄扃下，不见音容只见诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8533,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"徐氏致爽斋图（取拄笏西山之义）","author":"宋褧","text":"阴霾荡尽晓无霞，秋气萧森山气佳。\n万户千门城阙里，不知空翠落谁家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8534,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送章生还江陵（三首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"六尺身躯二十强，长安索米日仓皇。\n多应梦里还家乐，菜市街头春酒香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8535,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送章生还江陵（三首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"荆门驿路草萋萋，郢树连云晓色迷。\n因忆儿时赏心处，女贞杨柳夹濠堤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8536,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送章生还江陵（三首） 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"南国相知音信疏，暮云春树渺愁予。\n东风解办含情句，代作长江双鲤鱼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8537,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"秋江小景","author":"宋褧","text":"霜落吴江息暮涛，荻芦花叶冷萧骚。\n山林真隐今谁在，画里渔舟亦自高。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8538,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赵集贤致政（二首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"集贤学士鬓双皤，少日轩车意气多。\n有口惟称老聃语，向人不晓缺壶歌。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8539,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赵集贤致政（二首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"酒满清尊花满丛，高年乐事政无穷。\n近来好语君休报，惊动林间矍铄翁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8540,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送同年王在中编修代祀西行（六首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"宫云拥节下青冥，巨岳通川草木荣。\n传语祠官休秘祝，汉王深意在苍生。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8541,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送同年王在中编修代祀西行（六首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"银盝天香出帝都，春衣綷粲马连?。\n城南关吏争来认，曾向当年见弃繻。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8542,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]